{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ねね、かなりん、まりか／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この後ろで編み込みした髪型、\nみなさんから好評なのよね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個握でしようかなー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー服どーしよー服どーしよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお家でごろんごろん\nしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのさ、また食べ物の話に\nなるんだけどさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七草粥食べてからお粥に\nはまっちゃってね～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は3食お粥でしたよ。\nあ、もちろんおかずも食べたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、無糖のヨーグルトと蜂蜜に\nはまってるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、今日ウォーキングしたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとだけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか自分健康的じゃない？？！\n...て自己満足で終わるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"能條さんの帽子のポンポンをがうっち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......私のブログって\n半分デコメに助けられてるよね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/01/12/0225260/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}